OL,3,GNEWSAWomen says 40-mile journey to
OL,4,Ahospital while having contractions was
OL,5,A'scary'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman who was rushed 40 miles (64km)
OL,8,Fto a maternity unit after going into
OL,9,Fpremature labour says her experience
OL,10,Fshows why services must remain at her
OL,11,Flocal hospital.
OL,13,FBecause she required specialist care,
OL,14,Fmidwives at Daisy Hill in Newry wanted
OL,15,Fto send Natasha Daryaie to Craigavon
OL,16,FArea Hospital but were told there was
OL,17,Fno room.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
