OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWomen says 40-mile journey to
OL,4,Ahospital while having contractions was
OL,5,A'scary'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Southern Health Trust plans to
OL,8,Ftemporarily transfer inpatient
OL,9,Fmaternity services from Daisy Hill to
OL,10,FCraigavon because it has been unable to
OL,11,Frecruit enough consultant obstetricians
OL,12,Fto safely staff both hospitals.
OL,14,FA spokesperson for the trust said that,
OL,15,Ffollowing operational and workforce
OL,16,Fassessments, inpatient maternity care
OL,17,Fat Craigavon had been identified as the
OL,18,Fsafest and most sustainable arrangement
OL,19,Ffor maintaining services.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
